+- Successful publisher run: `31938218225`
+- Successful Dispatcher run: `31938224725`
+- Fresh-request publisher confirmation: `31938516583`
+- Infrastructure merge commit: `6e5162f70b2c7f15666f8659ebd3978eaf3f00ef`
